## 6. Gherkin contract fulfilment

| Scenario | Fulfilled by |
|----------|--------------|
| Valid payload returns 200 | `RunQuery` → `Ok(PromptLabRunResponse)` |
| Response contains `GeneratedResponse` | `PromptLabRunResponse.GeneratedResponse` |
| Response contains `RetrievedContextCount` | `contexts.Count` |
| Services called exactly once | Single `SearchAsync` + `GenerateAsync` call in `RunQuery` |
| Temperature out of `[0,1]` → 400 | First-range guard returns the exact message |
| Threshold out of `[0,1]` → 400 | Range guard returns the exact message |
| Empty `SystemPrompt` → 400 | `IsNullOrWhiteSpace` guard |
| Empty `TestQuery` → 400 | `IsNullOrWhiteSpace` guard |

